    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Films in grace, and the day they go",
      "description": "Maintainerr's rule is 'watched more than two days ago', so this is when each one becomes eligible. Its collection handler runs at 00:00 and 12:00, so the deletion lands at the first of those after the date shown. Empty means nothing has been watched in the last two days.",
